OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'I was lured into a trap': Evan
OL,4,AGershkovich on moment that led to 16
OL,5,Amonths in Russian jail
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I'm not interrogated, I'm not
OL,8,Ftortured... I'm accused of espionage,"
OL,9,Fhe said, describing a sense of relief:
OL,10,F"They've set me up and fabricated this
OL,11,Fcase so that I can be a valuable
OL,12,Fhostage - a pawn in a greater game".
OL,14,FGershkovich, now 34, was sentenced to
OL,15,F16 years in prison, but freed 16 months
OL,16,Flater as part of a high-profile
OL,17,Fprisoner swap deal.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
